{"id": "64412", "title": "先解风情后解衣", "author": "时无两", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 18, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/64/64412.htm", "intro": "他宠着我，惯着我，腻着我，可是真相是，娶我只是为了让他自己心安。\r\n人家说七年之痒，这才多久，甜蜜之下掩盖的伤口就被抓破，鲜血淋漓，血肉模糊。\r\n既然他每晚疯狂叫我肉疼，我就在外招惹叫他心疼。\r\n是逢场作戏，还是假戏真做，可我只道假作真来真亦假，嫁来嫁去都是他。\r\n\r\n一句话：已婚女子好，麻烦少来宜扑倒\r\n\r\n内容标签：都市情缘 高干 婚恋", "base": "files/article/html/64/64412", "chapters": [{"title": "→解风情1←", "file": "9604165.html", "available": false}, {"title": "→解风情2←", "file": "9604167.html", "available": false}, {"title": "→解风情3←", "file": "9604169.html", "available": false}, {"title": "→解风情4←", "file": "9604171.html", "available": false}, {"title": "→解风情5←", "file": "9604173.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6-10", "file": "9604175.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11-15", "file": "9604176.html", "available": false}, {"title": "16-20", "file": "9604177.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21-25", "file": "9604179.html", "available": false}, {"title": "26-30", "file": "9604181.html", "available": false}, {"title": "31-35", "file": "9604183.html", "available": false}, {"title": "36-40", "file": "9604185.html", "available": false}, {"title": "41-45", "file": "9604188.html", "available": false}, {"title": "46-50", "file": "9604190.html", "available": false}, {"title": "51-54", "file": "9604193.html", "available": false}, {"title": "55-58", "file": "9604195.html", "available": false}, {"title": "59-63", "file": "9604197.html", "available": false}, {"title": "64-68", "file": "9604200.html", "available": false}]}